claim('3cde50','Three searched cache rows and completion marker','For valid helper result and WORD+76 in1..15, searches three cache rows by two keys. A match marks used and returns. Otherwise selects the first clear used-bit among three rows, writes its keys, constructs the regional battle-voice path, requests loading via3A0B30 with3CDDF0 callback, sets context+24=1, and yields until that marker clears.','After all three searched rows are marked used and no key matches, the local index advances to3 and is used without a local rejection. Physical cache allocation, reserved fallback-row intent and live reachability are not established: no out-of-bounds/crash claim. Callback ordering relative to setting the wait marker is external.')
